{5040}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlowmpb]}
{6000}{}{Ouch, that does look a little painful. That will be @lex price@$ .}
{6010}{}{Nunga.}
{6020}{}{OK, here you go.}
{6030}{}{K, me giv?}
{6040}{}{I don't have enough money.}
{7000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'razlo08n']}
{7010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo06n]}
{7020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo14n]}
{7030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo14n]}
{8000}{}{You don't have enough money! I'm sorry, but my work ethic doesn't permit me to heal for free, you know. Come back when you have enough money.}
{8010}{}{Thanks for nothing.}
{8020}{}{Nunga.}
{8030}{}{How about a Radscorpion tail instead?}
{8040}{}{Scorpin, Scorpin?}
{8050}{}{Can you take something in trade?}
{8060}{}{My giv dis?}
{9000}{}{Let me see the sac! Yes, I can do something with this, as well as heal you for this great gift.}
{9010}{}{[Next...]}
{10000}{}{This will take a little bit of time. Come, relax in the back, while I work with the sac. You might have a slight headache from the junja juice, as well. Come, come . . .}
{10010}{}{[Done.]}
{11000}{}{Let's see here.}
{11010}{}{[...]}
{12000}{}{This will take a little bit of time. Come, relax in the back. You might have a slight headache from the junja juice, as well. Come, come . . .}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{Oh Great Brahmin! That is very, very serious. It will cost $50.}
{13010}{}{Nunga.}
{13020}{}{OK, here you go.}
{13030}{}{K, me giv?}
{13040}{}{I don't have enough money.}
{14000}{}{How can you still be walking?! This looks extremely serious. We'll need some special prayers for this one and a lot of luck. Not to mention @lex price@$.}
{14010}{}{Nunga.}
{14020}{}{OK, here you go.}
{14030}{}{K, me giv?}
{14040}{}{I don't have enough money.}
{15000}{}{You're barely hurt, you wimp. Come back in the morning.}
{15010}{}{[Done.]}
{16000}{}{You will be, if you keep me from my sleep. Now come back in the morning.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{Why would I be able to help you kill radscorpions? I'm a doctor, not a warrior. For that
you should see Aradesh, or even Tandi, or her boyfriend, Seth. Leave me.}
{17010}{}{I need something for their poison.}
{18000}{}{If I had a sample of their poison, I could create a cure.}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'razlo15n']}
{19010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo11n]}
{19020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo16n]}
{20000}{}{Hmm, Tandi is gone? I find this hard to believe, but maybe she ran away with Seth. I
know that they have been eyeing each other lately. Aradesh was always a little bit of a
prude, perhaps it was too much for her finally.}
{20010}{}{I don't think so, I think that she was kidnapped.}
{20020}{}{Perhaps, I'll go talk to some other people.}
{21000}{}{How awful! If that is the case, I hope she is not hurt. Who is looking for her?}
{21010}{}{Almost everyone.}
{21020}{}{Many people, including myself.}
{22000}{}{I hope she is found before it is too late.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{If she is hurt, it could be bad. Here, take these . . . I hope that you won't need them.}
{23010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> givestuff]}
{24000}{}{I have already given you as much as I can. Good luck.}
{24010}{}{[Done.]}
{25000}{}{Hnn?! What is that? Great, I get awakened by the great mumbling beast of the north. Come
back in the morning.}
{25010}{}{[Done.]}
{26000}{}{You look distraught. Are you in need of assistance?}
{26010}{}{Tandi has been kidnapped.}
{26020}{}{I need healing.}
{26030}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{26040}{}{Hng, Tanny boo.}
{27000}{}{Hmm, Tandi is gone? I find this hard to believe, but maybe she ran away with Seth. I
know that they have been eyeing each other lately. Aradesh was always a little bit of a
prude, perhaps it was too much for her finally.}
{27010}{}{I don't think so, I think that she was kidnapped.}
{27020}{}{Hmm, I didn't think of that.}
{27030}{}{Perhaps, I'll go talk to some other people.}
{28000}{}{Of course you do.}
{28010}{}{[...]}
{29000}{}{Let's see here.}
{29010}{}{[Next...]}
{29020}{}{[Next...]}
{29030}{}{[Next...]}
{30000}{}{You're barely hurt. I suggest a good nights sleep and some rest; you will heal naturally over time.}
{30010}{}{[Done.]}
{31000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'razlo23a']}
{31010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo25]}
{31020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> razlo24]}
{32000}{}{Here, let's see.
---
Yep, just as I thought. Let me get the cure.
---
You seem fine, now. Be careful in the future.}
{32010}{}{[Next...]}
{33000}{}{Stop by again, but stay healthy next time.}
{33010}{}{[Done.]}
{34000}{}{Sorry, I can't cure any poisons. I don't have the proper ingredients to make a decent anti-venom.}
{34010}{}{[Done.]}
{35000}{}{Tandi is gone? That is a terrible thing. I hope they find her.}
{35010}{}{[Done.]}
{36000}{}{Can I help you?}
{36010}{}{I need healing.}
{36020}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{36030}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{36040}{}{No.}
{36050}{}{Luki!}
{36060}{}{What do you know about Radscorpions?}
{36070}{}{I have a sample of the Radscorpion poison, can you do something with it?}
{36080}{}{Scorpin, Scorpin?}
{37000}{}{Hmmm. I think I've seen Brahmin with more brain cells then you. Well, let's see if you're wounded.}
{37010}{}{[...]}
{37020}{}{[...]}
{38000}{}{Well, you seem fine to me. Perhaps later, then?}
{38010}{}{[Done.]}
{39000}{}{And how such a large creature can even be possible by natural evolution, or even radiation induced mutation is beyond me.
---
Not too much. They seem to be extremely large versions of the north American Emperor scorpion. Contrary to my medical knowledge, their poison has grown more potent, not
diluted, as I would expect. Seth has been hunting them, which helps some of my tests.}
{39010}{}{You seem well educated. What are you doing here?}
{39020}{}{Anything else?}
{39030}{}{Thanks.}
{40000}{}{Doc Morbid in Junktown taught me some. And just because we live in stone huts, does not
mean we are less intelligent or educated. Have a nice day.}
{40010}{}{[Done.]}
{41000}{}{They seem to be sensitive to light. Nocturnal. If I could get a sample of their poison,
especially the venom production sac located in their tail, I could create an anti-venom.}
{41010}{}{Thanks.}
{42000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'razlo27a']}
{42010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{43000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{43010}{}{[Done.]}
{44000}{}{Let me see the sac! Yes, I can do something with this.}
{44010}{}{[Next...]}
{45000}{}{Here, take this as a free sample. It seems to work well against radscorpion stings, of course, but it shows much potential as a general anti-venom and poison cure.}
{45010}{}{[Done.]}
{46000}{}{I'm Razlo. Can I help you?}
{46010}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{46020}{}{Not right now, but it was nice meeting you.}
{46030}{}{I need healing.}
{46040}{}{Hnngh!}
{47000}{}{Hmmm, I don't like your looks. I hope that you have come for business, and will be
moving on shortly . . .}
{47010}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{47020}{}{No need to get defensive, I'm just looking around}
{47030}{}{Help, I need some healing.}
{48000}{}{My grief knows no end. Tandi, the only child of my good friend, is gone. I cannot work
right now.}
{48010}{}{[Done.]}
{49000}{}{I heard that you helped save Tandi. Congratulations and thank you. Anytime you need healing, come here.}
{49010}{}{[Done.]}
{50000}{}{I hope Tandi gets back soon. Aradesh must be feeling terrible right now.}
{50010}{}{[Done.]}
{51000}{}{I'm sorry but I can't help you.}
{51010}{}{[Done.]}
{52000}{}{Hello, again. How can I be of service?}
{52010}{}{I need healing.}
{52020}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{52030}{}{Ug!}
{52040}{}{Hello again. Just stopping by.}
{53000}{}{It was nice seeing you again. Have a good day.}
{53010}{}{[Done.]}
{54000}{}{Of course. It's you again. Now what?}
{54010}{}{I need healing.}
{54020}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{54030}{}{Nothing.}
{54040}{}{Luki!}

